The following files contain code derived from Darts, specifically from
`darts/models/forecasting/tide_model.py`:

  src/ga_tide/model.py
      - `_GATideModule` subclasses `darts.models.forecasting.tide_model
        ._TideModule`. Its `__init__` rebuilds the encoder, decoder, temporal
        decoder and covariate projections, and its `forward` is adapted from
        `_TideModule.forward` with the following modifications:
          * the flattened input segments are passed through the
            `SegmentAttentionFusion` module instead of being concatenated
            directly;
          * a runtime assertion on the segment widths has been added.
      - `GatedResidualBlock` is a modified reimplementation of
        `_ResidualBlock`, adding a sigmoid gate on the nonlinear branch and
        suppressing Layer Normalization for unit-width outputs.
      - `GATiDEModel` subclasses `darts.models.TiDEModel`; its `__init__` and
        `_create_model` are adapted from the corresponding methods.

